   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 508 of the laws of 2016 amending the tax law relating\nto the imposition of an occupancy tax in the village of Mamaroneck, in\nrelation to extending the expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8045",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8045-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §2, Chap 508 of 2016",
    "lawSection": "Taxation",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8045\n\nSPONSOR: MAYER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 508 of the laws of 2016 amending the tax law\nrelating to the imposition of an occupancy tax in the village of Mamaro-\nneck, in relation to extending the expiration thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo authorize the Village of Mamaroneck to enact a room occupancy tax not\nto exceed 3%.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis bill extends the current Village of Mamaroneck occupancy tax for\nanother three years until December 31, 2025.\n\n \nDIFFERENCE BETWEEN ORIGINAL AND AMENDED VERSION (IF APPLICABLE):\n\nn/a\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill extends the current Village of Mamaroneck occupancy tax. The\nVillage of Mamaroneck has used these non-property tax revenues to\ncontrol property tax increases and support Village expenses not fully\ndiscretionary.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2019: A6542/S5081 (Otis/MAYER), 12/20/19 signed chap. 697\n2016:  A9693/S7154 (Otis/LATIMER),12/31/16 signed chap.508\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nThe Village estimates revenues of $25,000 per year minus implementation\ncosts.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
